# EUCLID HITS / EUCLID ROTATE / VARY BAR (Steps' SEL, the bar's section): N hits spread evenly over the bar's steps, turned
# by a rotation, for the kit sound shown or the note remembered (that sound's steps in the bar replaced, the others
# kept); a variation of the bar, the beats kept, different each time; one undo each; the list opens on the row last used
wait 300
projnew
expect trk 1
step 1 1 4 2 100
step 1 1 5 1 100
step 1 1 20 1 100
tap SEQ
listen
tap SEL
row EUCLID HITS
wait 200
said EUCLID HITS 4 of 16
shot euclid_row.png
turn ALGO 1
wait 200
said EUCLID HITS 5 of 16
# 5 hits: steps 1 4 7 10 13; the old kick on step 5 gone, the snare on step 4 kept (a kick with it), bar 2 untouched
tap SEL
wait 100
said EUCLID 5 of 16, turn 0
shot euclid_done.png
expect barmask 1 1 1 1 0x1249
expect barmask 1 1 1 2 0x0008
expect note 1 1 4 1
expect note 1 1 20 1
expect listopen 0
# the list opens on the row again: SEL SEL does it once more, the same
tap SEL
wait 200
said EUCLID HITS 5 of 16
tap SEL
wait 50
expect barmask 1 1 1 1 0x1249
# the rotation: 2 steps on (steps 3 6 9 12 15); its row does the fill too
tap SEL
row EUCLID ROTATE
turn ALGO 2
wait 200
said EUCLID ROTATE by 2
shot euclid_rot.png
tap SEL
wait 50
expect barmask 1 1 1 1 0x4924
expect barmask 1 1 1 2 0x0008
# 16 hits: every step; 1 hit: one
tap SEL
row EUCLID HITS
turn ALGO 20
tap SEL
wait 50
expect barmask 1 1 1 1 0xffff
tap SEL
row EUCLID HITS
turn ALGO -20
tap SEL
wait 50
expect barmask 1 1 1 1 0x0004
# one undo: the bar before (the 16 hits)
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 50
expect barmask 1 1 1 1 0xffff
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 50
expect barmask 1 1 1 1 0x4924
# a synth track (T2), the note remembered (C4): 4 hits over a bar of 16 (steps 1 5 9 13), two turned: 3 7 11 15
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
step 2 1 2 70 100
tap SEQ
tap SEL
row EUCLID ROTATE
turn ALGO -2
row EUCLID HITS
turn ALGO 3
wait 200
said EUCLID HITS 4 of 16
tap SEL
wait 50
shot euclid_synth.png
expect barmask 2 1 1 0 0x1111
expect note 2 1 1 60
expect note 2 1 2 0
expect barmask 2 1 2 0 0x0000
# a shorter pattern: 12 steps, the bar's 12 steps: 3 hits on steps 1 5 9 (step 13 is past the pattern: as it was)
pat 2 1 12
tap SEL
wait 200
said EUCLID HITS 4 of 12
turn ALGO -1
tap SEL
wait 50
expect barmask 2 1 1 0 0x1111
expect note 2 1 13 60
# VARY BAR: the beats (steps 1 5 9 13) stay, whatever happens to the rest, again and again; the bar changes
pat 2 1 16
step 2 1 1 60 100
step 2 1 3 60 90
step 2 1 5 60 100
step 2 1 7 60 90
step 2 1 9 60 100
step 2 1 11 60 90
step 2 1 14 60 90
step 2 1 13 60 100
tap SEL
row VARY BAR
wait 200
said VARY BAR
shot vary_row.png
tap SEL
wait 100
said VARIED bar 1
shot vary_done.png
expect note 2 1 1 60
expect note 2 1 5 60
expect note 2 1 9 60
expect note 2 1 13 60
wait 30
tap SEL
tap SEL
wait 30
tap SEL
tap SEL
wait 30
tap SEL
tap SEL
wait 100
expect note 2 1 1 60
expect note 2 1 5 60
expect note 2 1 9 60
expect note 2 1 13 60
# one undo takes the last variation back; the hits are never more than they were, nor none
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 50
said UNDO T2 P1
shot vary_undo.png
# an empty bar (T3): nothing to vary, said
wait 1300
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 3
tap SEL
row VARY BAR
tap SEL
wait 100
said NOTHING TO VARY
shot vary_none.png
